                <!-- Beamcast design system (Penpot "Beamcast — Design", page 00). Brushes named Beam*Brush are
                     ours; the rest restyle the stock WinUI controls with the same colours. Generated once
                     from a colour table: keep the two dictionaries in step when changing a colour.
                     It is a merged dictionary placed after XamlControlsResources on purpose: a dictionary's
                     own ThemeDictionaries are looked up after its merged ones, so overrides put directly
                     on the application dictionary lose to the stock brushes. -->
                <ResourceDictionary>
                    <ResourceDictionary.ThemeDictionaries>
